{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 7,
  "name": "地水师",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00958",
              "text": "师。贞，丈人吉，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00958",
                "bodyParagraph": 894
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00959",
              "text": "象曰：地中有水，师。君子以容民畜众。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00959",
                "bodyParagraph": 895
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00961",
              "text": "师卦：占问总指挥的军情，没有灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00961",
                "bodyParagraph": 897
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00962",
              "text": "《象辞》说：下卦为坎，坎为水；上卦为坤，坤为地，像“地中有水”，这是师卦的卦象。君子观此卦象，取法于容纳江河的大地，收容和畜养大众。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00962",
                "bodyParagraph": 898
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00964",
              "text": "师卦坤上坎下，为坎宫归魂卦。师即兵众，只有选择德高望重的长者来统率军队，才能吉祥无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00964",
                "bodyParagraph": 900
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00966",
              "text": "忧劳动众，变化无穷；公正无私，排除万难。 得此卦者，困难重重，忧心劳众，宜包容别人，艰苦努力，摒除一切困难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00966",
                "bodyParagraph": 902
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00968",
              "text": "时运：包容别人，修行待时。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00968",
                "bodyParagraph": 904
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00969",
              "text": "财运：有财有库，善自珍惜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00969",
                "bodyParagraph": 905
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00970",
              "text": "家宅：旧亲联姻，可喜可贺。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00970",
                "bodyParagraph": 906
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00971",
              "text": "身体：腹胀之症，调气无忧。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00971",
                "bodyParagraph": 907
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00973",
              "text": "这个卦是异卦（下坎上坤）相叠。“师”指军队。坎为水、为险；坤为地、为顺，喻寓兵于农。兵凶战危，用兵乃圣人不得已而为之，但它可以顺利无阻碍地解决矛盾，因为顺乎形势，师出有名，故能化凶为吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00973",
                "bodyParagraph": 909
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00974",
              "text": "大象：养兵聚众，出师攻伐之象，彼此有伤，难得安宁。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00974",
                "bodyParagraph": 910
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00975",
              "text": "运势：困难重重，凡事以正规行事，忌独断独行、投机取巧，提防潜在敌人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00975",
                "bodyParagraph": 911
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00976",
              "text": "事业：阻力很大，困难很多，处于激烈的竞争状态，要与他人密切合作，谨小慎微，行为果断，切忌盲目妄动，适度即可，注意保全自己。机动灵活，严于律已。从容沉着对付一切，必能成功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00976",
                "bodyParagraph": 912
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00977",
              "text": "经商：已有一定的积蓄，可以从事大的营销活动，但必卷入激烈商战，以刚毅顽强的精神和高尚的商业道德，辅以灵活的方法，勿贪图小利，勿掉以轻心，加强与他人的沟通，必可摆脱困境，化险为夷。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00977",
                "bodyParagraph": 913
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00978",
              "text": "求名：具备很好的条件，但须有正确的引导，务必严格要求自己，克服不利因素的干扰，经过扎实努力，必可名利双全。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00978",
                "bodyParagraph": 914
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00979",
              "text": "婚恋：慎重、专注，否则会陷入“三角”纠纷。痴情追求可以达到目的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00979",
                "bodyParagraph": 915
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00980",
              "text": "决策：天资聪颖，性格灵活，具有坚强的意志，对事业执着追求，迎难而进。可成就大事业。喜竞争，善争辩，富有冒险精神，不免带来麻烦，务老成持重，不贪功，以中正为要。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00980",
                "bodyParagraph": 916
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00982",
              "text": "师卦，此卦是异卦相叠，下卦为坎，上卦为坤。“师”指军队。坎为水、为险；坤为地、为顺，喻寓兵于农。兵凶战危，用兵乃圣人不得已而为之，但它可以顺利无阻碍地解决矛盾，因为顺乎形势，师出有名，故能化凶为吉。占得此卦，对于军事上率师出征非常有利，必无灾祸。师卦是天马出群之卦，以寡伏众之象。师卦位于讼卦之后，《序卦》之中这样解释道：“讼必有众起，故受之以师。师者，众也。”争讼的人越来越多，以致形成了军队。《象》中这样解释师卦：师卦的形象，下卦“坎”为险，水；",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00982",
                "bodyParagraph": 918
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00983",
              "text": "上卦“坤”为地，顺。整个卦象就是地下有水。水潜藏在地下取之不尽，也就是士兵来源于农民中间。因而，这一卦象征“师”。君子观此象，应当效法这一精神，平素能容民养民如大地蓄水。在人民当中蓄积兵众的力量，以备战时用之不竭。师卦之象：有虎、马、牛指寅午未;将军立于台上，主掌兵权;执印者拜于地，指受赏。天马出群之卦，以寡服众象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00983",
                "bodyParagraph": 919
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00986",
              "text": "初六。师出以律，否臧凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00986",
                "bodyParagraph": 922
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00987",
              "text": "象曰：师出以律，失律凶也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00987",
                "bodyParagraph": 923
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00989",
              "text": "初六：整军出战全凭纪律，不遵守纪律就会有凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00989",
                "bodyParagraph": 925
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00990",
              "text": "《象辞》说：整军出战全凭纪律，失去纪律的约束就会带来凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00990",
                "bodyParagraph": 926
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00992",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，经营得当，则财货日增。但妄动者，成少败多。不良者，多险难刑伤。做官的宜谨守正道，则会得到上级的欣赏。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00992",
                "bodyParagraph": 928
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00994",
              "text": "时运：失道以求，终受其辱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00994",
                "bodyParagraph": 930
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00995",
              "text": "财运：海运业务，合义则吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00995",
                "bodyParagraph": 931
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00996",
              "text": "家宅：治家以法，否则必凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00996",
                "bodyParagraph": 932
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00997",
              "text": "身体：寒多热少，宜早医治。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00997",
                "bodyParagraph": 933
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00999",
              "text": "初六爻动变得周易第19卦：地泽临。这个卦是异卦（下兑上坤）相叠。坤为地，兑为泽，地高于泽，泽容于地。喻君主亲临天下，治国安邦，上下融洽。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00999",
                "bodyParagraph": 935
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01001",
              "text": "师卦第一爻爻辞释义 律：军纪，纪律。否(仏)臧(巧叩):不好。这里指不守军纪。本爻爻辞的意思是：出师征战必须要有严明的纪律，如果军纪混乱必然有凶 从卦象上看，初六属于阴爻居于阳位，又处于下卦坎之中，像才质柔弱、能力很差而不又归正的基层小兵一样。对于这样的小兵，必须严明军纪，严加管束，否则整个军队就会像一盘散沙，没有战斗力。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01001",
                "bodyParagraph": 937
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01002",
              "text": "占得此卦者，如果自己是老板或领导的话，一定要注意严明纪律，人好不如制度好，如果对一切行为活动都制定了准则，并严格按此来执行，那么部下的工作就会井井有条。一定要对下面的人严格约束，不然公司或单位将面临危险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01002",
                "bodyParagraph": 938
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01005",
              "text": "九二。在师中，吉无咎，王三锡命。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01005",
                "bodyParagraph": 941
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01006",
              "text": "象曰：在师中吉，承天宠也，王三锡命，怀万邦也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01006",
                "bodyParagraph": 942
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01008",
              "text": "九二：主帅身在军中指挥，吉利，没有灾难。君王三次颁命嘉奖。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01008",
                "bodyParagraph": 944
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01009",
              "text": "《象辞》说：主帅身在军中指挥，吉利，因为得到上天的宠爱。君王三次颁命嘉奖，因为主帅能怀徕万国。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01009",
                "bodyParagraph": 945
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01011",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，会遇到贵人，谋事可成。做官的会受到上级的赏识，有升迁之机会。读书人会取得佳绩。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01011",
                "bodyParagraph": 947
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01013",
              "text": "时运：杰出人才，大受赏识。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01013",
                "bodyParagraph": 949
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01014",
              "text": "财运：谋略出众，领导获利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01014",
                "bodyParagraph": 950
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01015",
              "text": "家宅：邻里所重；婚姻吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01015",
                "bodyParagraph": 951
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01016",
              "text": "身体：流动血气，病即舒解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01016",
                "bodyParagraph": 952
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01018",
              "text": "九二爻动变得周易第2卦：坤为地。这个卦是同卦（下坤上坤）相叠，阴性。象征地（与乾卦相反），顺从天，承载万物，伸展无穷无尽。坤卦以雌马为象征，表明地道生育抚养万物，而又依天顺时，性情温顺。它以“先迷后得”证明“坤”顺从“乾”，依随“乾”，才能把握正确方向，遵循正道，获取吉利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01018",
                "bodyParagraph": 954
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01020",
              "text": "王：君王。锡命：赐命，意思是下令嘉奖。 本爻的爻义是：在军中任统帅，持中不偏可得吉祥，不会有什么灾祸;君王多次赐命嘉奖。 从卦象上看，九二居下卦中位，九二与六五正应，六五为天位或天子位，对九二全力支持，所以会嘉奖九二，并会委以重任。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01020",
                "bodyParagraph": 956
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01021",
              "text": "《象》曰：“在师中吉”，承天宠也;“王三锡命”，怀万邦也。占得此卦者，要学习召公虎，走得正，行得端，那么就不会有什么灾难，会得到嘉奖与提升了。九二身为三军主帅，重权在握，自然吉祥没有灾难。能够受此重任，说明天子对他的信任与宠爱。君王对他进行三次赐命，说明君王对他寄予了安邦定国的重望。九二艾与君位的六五艾相应，所以可以得到君王的赐命。在《周礼》中说:“一命受职，再命受服，三命受位。”可见这所赐三命是给予极大的权力。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01021",
                "bodyParagraph": 957
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01022",
              "text": "古人认为，这一艾指的便是武王带兵有功而受文王的奖赏，由于此时武王还没有继位，所以还不能称为“君”。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01022",
                "bodyParagraph": 958
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01025",
              "text": "六三。师或舆尸，凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01025",
                "bodyParagraph": 961
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01026",
              "text": "象曰：师或舆尸，大无功也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01026",
                "bodyParagraph": 962
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01028",
              "text": "六三：军队出征，有人载尸而归，这是凶险之兆。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01028",
                "bodyParagraph": 964
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01029",
              "text": "《象辞》说：军队出征，有人载尸而归，这是前方吃了败仗。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01029",
                "bodyParagraph": 965
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01031",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，多有悲优，或家中亲人病故。做官的会受职待缺。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01031",
                "bodyParagraph": 967
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01033",
              "text": "时运：无德有位，难免于凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01033",
                "bodyParagraph": 969
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01034",
              "text": "财运：物耗财损，凶险无比。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01034",
                "bodyParagraph": 970
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01035",
              "text": "家宅：不得安宁，小心为上。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01035",
                "bodyParagraph": 971
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01036",
              "text": "身体：可能归天。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01036",
                "bodyParagraph": 972
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01038",
              "text": "六三爻动变得周易第46卦：地风升。这个卦是异卦（下巽上坤）相叠。坤为地、为顺；巽为木、为逊。大地生长树木，逐渐成长，日渐高大成材，喻事业步步高升，前程远大，故名“升”。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01038",
                "bodyParagraph": 974
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01040",
              "text": "师卦第三爻爻辞释义 舆：指车辆。舆尸：指用车辆运载尸体，兵败之状。 此爻的爻义是：不时有士兵从战场上运送战死者的尸体回来，凶险。 从卦象上看，六三属于阴爻居于阳位，才质柔弱又冒进躁动，其处于下卦坎的上端，坎卦象征危险，六三这一爻处于极端危险之中，必须谨防慎守，不可盲目冒进。可是六三却乘于九二之上，意味着不听主帅的安排，违抗军令，轻敌冒进，所以必然大败而归。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01040",
                "bodyParagraph": 976
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01041",
              "text": "《象》曰：“师或舆尸”，大无功也。这句话的意思是说，“士兵不时运送战死者的尸体回来”，说明不能知己知彼，在敌强我弱的情况下，不自量力发动进攻，结果战败，没有任何功绩可言了。 出兵回来，结果车上拉的不是战利品，全是阵亡将士的尸体，怎么能不凶险呢?一方面，肯定是战败而归，刚经历战场上的凶险;另一方面，主帅肯定也饶不了这次出征的将领，这是回来后的凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01041",
                "bodyParagraph": 977
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01044",
              "text": "六四。师左次，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01044",
                "bodyParagraph": 980
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01045",
              "text": "象曰：左次无咎，未失常也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01045",
                "bodyParagraph": 981
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01047",
              "text": "六四：军队在左边扎营，没有危险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01047",
                "bodyParagraph": 983
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01048",
              "text": "《象辞》说：军队在左边扎营，没有危险，因为军队驻扎或左或右，唯视地理环境、敌我形势而定，并没有违背行军常道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01048",
                "bodyParagraph": 984
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01050",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，安居乐业，无妄动之灾。做官的官运不济，不宜妄想。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01050",
                "bodyParagraph": 986
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01052",
              "text": "时运：官运不济，不宜妄想。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01052",
                "bodyParagraph": 988
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01053",
              "text": "财运：次级货物，尚可获利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01053",
                "bodyParagraph": 989
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01054",
              "text": "家宅：近东，朝西南吉；入赘无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01054",
                "bodyParagraph": 990
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01055",
              "text": "身体：春生气来，疾病可愈。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01055",
                "bodyParagraph": 991
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01057",
              "text": "六四爻动变得周易第40卦：雷水解。这个卦是异卦（下坎上震）相叠。震为雷、为动；坎为水、为险。险在内，动在外。严冬天地闭塞，静极而动。万象更新，冬去春来，一切消除，是为解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01057",
                "bodyParagraph": 993
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01059",
              "text": "师卦第四爻爻义释义 左：在古代的军队中崇尚右，右是前进，而左则撤退。次：是指驻扎两天以上。《左传》中有这样一句话：“凡师，一宿为舍，再宿为信，过信为次。”这就是对“次”的解释。这句爻辞的辞义是：率军暂时撤退，免得遭受损失。我们来看六四这一爻，属于阴爻居于柔位，所以有退避之象。《象》中对此爻的解释是：“左次无咎”，示失常也。占得此卦者，应该根据客观情况，及时调整自己的部署，最好能暂时退一退，这是为了更好地实现自己的目标。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01059",
                "bodyParagraph": 995
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01060",
              "text": "这里是告诉人们，打仗不一定非得求胜，当不能取胜时，要懂得退避以保持实力。只有这样，才不会有大的灾难。毛泽东倡导的游击战便体现出这一含义。敌进我退，敌退我扰的战略方针，既保存了自己的战斗实力，又有效地消灭了敌人。古语云，胜败乃兵家常事。但败仗中要懂得保全实力，减少损失。比如诸葛壳六出岐山，都打了败仗，但撤退时巧妙布局，并没有造成大的人员伤亡，保存了战斗力，所以诸葛亮的六出岐山虽然是打了六次败仗，却仍然没有减损诸葛亮用兵如神的光辉形象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01060",
                "bodyParagraph": 996
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01063",
              "text": "六五。田有禽，利执言，无咎。长子帅师，弟子舆尸，贞凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01063",
                "bodyParagraph": 999
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01064",
              "text": "象曰：长子帅师，以中行也；弟子舆尸，使不当也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01064",
                "bodyParagraph": 1000
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01066",
              "text": "六五：打猎时获得猎物，作战中捕获俘虏，没有灾祸。长子指挥军队，次子战败阵亡，这是凶险的贞兆。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01066",
                "bodyParagraph": 1002
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01067",
              "text": "《象辞》说：以长子指挥军队，这是依正道行事。次子战败阵亡，这是因为差遣不当。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01067",
                "bodyParagraph": 1003
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01069",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，财富日增，若用人得当，则谋望可成，但须谨防小人之危。做官的或有实权，或因为谏言而地位高显。读书人会取得佳绩。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01069",
                "bodyParagraph": 1005
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01071",
              "text": "时运：德胜于才，否则凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01071",
                "bodyParagraph": 1007
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01072",
              "text": "财运：老成练达，有利可图。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01072",
                "bodyParagraph": 1008
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01073",
              "text": "家宅：利于长子；媒妁而成。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01073",
                "bodyParagraph": 1009
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01074",
              "text": "身体：跑步健身。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01074",
                "bodyParagraph": 1010
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01076",
              "text": "六五爻动变得周易第29卦：坎为水。这个卦是同卦（下坎上坎）相叠。坎为水、为险，两坎相重，险上加险，险阻重重。一阳陷二阴。所幸阴虚阳实，诚信可豁然贯通。虽险难重重，却方能显人性光彩。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01076",
                "bodyParagraph": 1012
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01078",
              "text": "师卦第五爻爻辞释义 利执言：是猎捕的说词，田中有野兽，也代指国家有叛乱生事的人，这些是出师的理由，所以把这些理由跟人们说清楚，属于出师有名，这样是没有灾难 从卦象上看，六五爻属于阴爻居于君位，居中不正。阴爻在君位，一般会缺阳刚之气而具备阴柔之德，不会主动发动进攻，主张和平正义，而且对待臣子很谦和，礼贤下士。在这一卦之中，肯定是有敌人来犯，所以属于正义战争。臣子们非常拥护六五，作战热情很高。这里关键的就是六五能不能知人善任了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01078",
                "bodyParagraph": 1014
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01079",
              "text": "对于六五的爻辞，《象》是这样的解释的：“长子帅师”，以中行也;“弟子舆尸”，使不当也。我们看整个爻辞，前面说的是出师有名，是没有灾难的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01079",
                "bodyParagraph": 1015
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01082",
              "text": "上六。大君有命，开国承家，小人勿用。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01082",
                "bodyParagraph": 1018
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01083",
              "text": "象曰：大君有命，以正功也；小人勿用，必乱邦也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01083",
                "bodyParagraph": 1019
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01085",
              "text": "上六：国君颁发命令，有人被封为诸侯，享有封国，有人被封为大夫，享有采邑。但是不要重用无才无德的小人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01085",
                "bodyParagraph": 1021
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01086",
              "text": "《象辞》说：国君颁发封赏功臣的命令，这是论功行赏。不要重用无才无德的小人，因为小人必定覆国乱邦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01086",
                "bodyParagraph": 1022
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01088",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，可立家计，或继承家业，但谨防小人从中作梗。做官的会当权立功。专业人才则会技艺成名。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01088",
                "bodyParagraph": 1024
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01090",
              "text": "时运：论功行赏，勿做小人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01090",
                "bodyParagraph": 1026
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01091",
              "text": "财运：因富致贵，须防小人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01091",
                "bodyParagraph": 1027
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01092",
              "text": "家宅：家道兴旺；贵人做媒。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01092",
                "bodyParagraph": 1028
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01093",
              "text": "身体：正常运动。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01093",
                "bodyParagraph": 1029
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01095",
              "text": "上六爻动变得周易第4卦：山水蒙。这个卦是异卦（下坎上艮）相叠，艮是山的形象，喻止；坎是水的形象，喻险。卦形为山下有险，仍不停止前进，是为蒙昧，故称蒙卦。但因把握时机，行动切合时宜，因此，具有启蒙和通达的卦象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01095",
                "bodyParagraph": 1031
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01097",
              "text": "师卦第六爻爻辞释义 大君：是君王，天子。国：是指诸候的领地，也就是把有功的人封为诸候， 赏给领地;家：是大夫的领地，是指把功臣封为大夫，赏给领地。本爻的爻义是指：凯旋而归，天子颁布了诏命，分封功臣，或封为诸侯，或封为上卿，或封为大夫，但小人绝不可以重用。上六这一爻，是指作战结束，班师回朝，开始论功行赏了，这一爻主要指示了该如何封赏作战的将士。占得此卦者，若是老板或领导，员工或下级做出了成绩或贡献，一定要按功行赏。但是，在嘉赏小人时要注意方式。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01097",
                "bodyParagraph": 1033
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01098",
              "text": "这里讲的便是武王灭纣而分封诸侯的情景。此时武王已经登基为天子，成为众诸侯的盟主，所以称为“大君”。“开国承家”，便是分封各位有功的将领及谋士。武王封赏第一个谋士是姜子牙，姜子牙被称为周师齐祖，因为他是齐国的幵国领袖，所以是“齐袓”。建立了新的政权，最应该注意的是“小人勿用”。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01098",
                "bodyParagraph": 1034
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
